"This Call Flow is still used by:\n"
"%(references)s\n"
"Reassign those destinations before deleting it."
msgstr ""
"Call Flow ນີ້ຍັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ອີກໂດຍ:\n"
"%(references)s\n"
"ກະລຸນາກຳນົດປາຍທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃໝ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລຶບ."

